You wanna see that?

162
00:05:03.824 --> 00:05:04.657 line:15%
Yes.

163
00:05:04.657 --> 00:05:05.537 line:15%
Okay.

164
00:05:05.537 --> 00:05:06.447
And Trump.

165
00:05:06.447 --> 00:05:07.959
You wanna meet Trump.

166
00:05:07.959 --> 00:05:08.909
That's the guy you wanna meet?

167
